 "text": "Hi! How's everything with you right now? It' lovely, especially if you can find nice park with playground nearby. It shows you' thinking of the child without overcommitting. Stick it inside a bag or briefcase with few thin wall pads so it pops out. Or use a dish towel as a sort of buffer. Sandwiches, bite sized snacks, some packed fruit and yogurt, a cup of tea or water, and small toy or book. Keep everything tightly sealed so hands get dirty and the baby gets wet. A blanket and some wipes in your bag too, and always leave with a warm coat on if you leave the park.",
